Xeon Phi toolchain

This distribution contains LLVM/Clang modifications and original toolchain,
runtime, test and application-integration work. It is an independent project,
not an Intel product and not endorsed by Intel or the upstream projects.

LLVM and compiler-rt: Apache License 2.0 with LLVM exceptions.
llama.cpp modifications: retain the upstream MIT license in licenses/llama.txt.
musl-derived math sources: retain their individual source notices and the
complete runtime/musl-math/COPYRIGHT file.
Rust examples/runtime support in this repository are original project code;
Rust compiler/std are fetched separately under their upstream MIT/Apache terms.
GCC/libstdc++ and the Intel MPSS SDK are external dependencies, not distributed
in this source release. Their existing licenses remain applicable.

Detailed upstream revisions and component notes: sources.lock.json and
THIRD_PARTY.md. No model weights are included.
